From: Armbian BPI-R4 Pro 8X port
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: report RF file as external EEPROM data

Return one when the RF file loads. MT7996 then validates and retains
the data instead of clearing the buffer before reading eFuse.
Keep the missing-file fallback unchanged.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/eeprom.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/eeprom.c
@@ -474,7 +474,7 @@ mt76_eeprom_init(struct mt76_dev *dev, int len)
 
 	ret = mt76_get_eeprom_file(dev, len);
 	if (!ret)
-		return 0;
+		return 1;
 
 	return !mt76_get_of_eeprom(dev, dev->eeprom.data, len);
 }
